# Copy to .env for local overrides. Every variable is optional in development
# and test; safe defaults point at the docker-compose PostgreSQL instance.
# In production, DATABASE_URL is required and has no default.

# development | test | production
NODE_ENV=development
# fatal | error | warn | info | debug | trace | silent
LOG_LEVEL=debug
HTTP_HOST=127.0.0.1
HTTP_PORT=3000
DATABASE_URL=postgres://ltw:ltw_dev_password@127.0.0.1:54329/ltw
# dev-personas (default outside production; refused in production, with PUBLIC_ORIGIN set, or
# when HTTP_HOST is not loopback) | invitations | disabled
# (default in production: nobody signs in until a mode is chosen). docs/adr/0036-production-sign-in.md
AUTH_MODE=dev-personas
# Persona token file for dev-personas mode (default: fixtures/ravenford/personas.json)
# DEV_PERSONAS_FILE=/absolute/path/personas.json
# Invitations mode only, and required there: the browser's origin, exactly https://<host>[:<port>]
# (plain http only for localhost outside production). Invitation links, the session cookie's
# Secure flag and the origin check of every non-GET request and the live stream use it. The DM's
# first link comes from `pnpm auth:operator dm-invite --campaign <id> --expires-hours <1-168>`;
# `revoke-dm`, `revoke-actor` and `sessions` revoke and list sessions (docs/STAGE_340_DESIGN.md).
# PUBLIC_ORIGIN=https://table.example
# Required in invitations mode, optional elsewhere: `none` when clients reach the server directly,
# or the reverse proxy's addresses or CIDR ranges, comma-separated (never /0). Only a request from
# one of them has its X-Forwarded-For read, so sign-in limits count each client, not the proxy.
# LTW_TRUST_PROXY=
# AI gateway (docs/adr/0017-ai-gateway.md). Without a key only the deterministic
# local provider runs. The key is never logged or traced.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Unused by routing (routes name their own models; see LTW_AI_ROUTES below).
# LTW_AI_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5
# LTW_AI_TIMEOUT_MS=30000
# How long a context request with ranking=ai waits for the relevance ranker
# before answering with the deterministic ranking (docs/adr/0021-ai-relevance.md).
# LTW_AI_RELEVANCE_BUDGET_MS=2000

# Live AI, Stage 300 (docs/adr/0032-live-ai.md). Keys go in .env.local, never in the repository.
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
# LTW_DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-flash
# Each capability's providers in order, `provider:model`: `local`, or one remote then `local`
# (relevance: one remote only). Three entries, two remotes, or a remote without its key are startup
# errors. A key alone implies no route. Owner decisions 3 and 6: Sonnet 5.5 is the only paid runtime
# text model, for DM intents, NPC dialogue and Chronicle; relevance ranking stays on the deterministic
# Context Engine (no fast-context entry; revisit after Sonnet latency is measured). A remote entry is
# used only through durable admission, with a selected stored approval and a verified pricing-catalog
# entry. The only verified entry is anthropic:claude-sonnet-5-5 (2026-10-12;
# apps/server/src/ai/catalog-sonnet-5-5.ts); any other model is refused at startup. Even then a
# request sends nothing without an active play session in its campaign (DM preparation and Chronicle
# after a session closes stay local). Each attempt holds the full 1M-token context plus max_tokens
# (about $2.54-$2.63) until settled. Effort and max_tokens per capability are fixed in code
# (apps/server/src/ai/request-settings.ts), not configuration.
# LTW_AI_ROUTES=reasoning=anthropic:claude-sonnet-5-5,local;npc-dialogue=anthropic:claude-sonnet-5-5,local;narrative=anthropic:claude-sonnet-5-5,local
# The operator-created approval this process selects (`pnpm ai:operator approval-create`). It only
# names a stored record: its ceilings cannot be set or raised here.
# LTW_AI_APPROVAL_ID=
# Whole-request deadline of DM intents, NPC replies and Chronicle (1000-300000 ms), covering request
# start, admission, every attempt and the trace write. LTW_AI_TIMEOUT_MS is the per-attempt bound.
# LTW_AI_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS=60000
# Spending ceilings are not environment settings: they are operator records (`pnpm ai:operator`,
# docs/adr/0032-live-ai.md). LTW_AI_DAILY_BUDGET_USD was removed and is ignored with a warning.
